linux/scripts/02-toolchain/setup-dependencies.sh | main | 98 | F1 2026-09-04 reviewed, KEEP: 87 code lines that are a 5-valued-flag parse loop (plus -h and a catch-all) and an 11-command dispatch case, each arm 2-8 lines of source_module and install calls. Splitting yields eleven one-call wrappers and hides the lazy-sourcing pattern (TG1) the arms exist to show side by side
